Rufus for macOS (RufusMac) - Professional Windows 11 Bootable USB Creator
Engineered for macOS (including macOS 27 / Sequoia / Sonoma / Apple Silicon & Intel)

Features:
- Full Windows 11 24H2 / 23H2 / 22H2 UEFI bootable drive creation
- Automatic detection of external USB thumb drives (with strict internal disk protection)
- Dual-Partition Universal UEFI Architecture (FAT32 Boot + ExFAT Data)
  * Solves the >4GB install.wim FAT32 limitation without third-party tools
  * Works on 100% of UEFI motherboards out of the box
- Optional Single-Partition Split WIM (SWM) support via wimlib if installed
- Windows 11 Bypasses (Rufus WUE):
  * Bypass TPM 2.0, Secure Boot, 4GB+ RAM, Storage & CPU checks
  * Bypass mandatory Microsoft online account requirement (BypassNRO)
